"""
In-game changelog, viewable via the 'changes' command.

Each entry is a (version, summary) pair -- a single one-line summary,
no details, matching what a player would want at a glance. Versions
are plain strings (not computed via float arithmetic, which would
introduce rounding error) starting at 0.10 and increasing by 0.10 per
entry, oldest first.

Add a new entry here whenever a player-facing change ships; this file
is the single source of truth for the 'changes' command.
"""

